** Reference TTT data of AtoM, NOT READ by Abaqus (the input option of AtoM is KM, coefficient above).
** The two proportions are of the CHILD phase (5 % martensite at Ms, 90 % at Ms - 230 K), the
** meaning of the KM calibration formula of the guide and of its AISI 5140 verification input
** (0.05, 0.90 with gamma = 0.0194 between 333 and 217 C); the table reference page of the guide
** calls them parent proportions: check on one element before switching AtoM to TTT.
